  "title": "Devil Avalanche",
  "description": "Paratroopers assigned to the 307th Brigade Support Battalion, 82nd Airborne Division conduct sling load operations during Devil Avalanche July 22, 2025 at Fort Bragg, North Carolina. Devil Avalanche is a training event that demonstrates 1st Brigade’s capability to deploy anywhere in the world within 18 hours; maintaining the Division’s mission as the Immediate Response Force of the United States. (U.S. Army video by Staff Sgt. Brandon Thomas)",
